#: docs/delivery/security-review.md:1
msgid "安全扫描与生命周期边界"
msgstr "Security scanning and lifecycle boundaries"

#: docs/delivery/security-review.md:3
msgid ""
"静态扫描分析当前工具、F4 生产实现和实际 host 构建；扫描执行与诊断审查分别记录。 "
"历史扫描结果不能代替本次源码执行。配置、证据与打包代码仍在检查范围，不能通过 移除所有权或路径检查消除诊断。"
msgstr ""
"Static scans analyze current tooling, production F4 implementations and "
"actual host builds. Record scan execution and diagnostic review separately. "
"Historical scan results do not replace execution on this source. "
"Configuration, evidence and packaging code remain in scope; do not remove "
"ownership or path checks to eliminate diagnostics."

#: docs/delivery/security-review.md:7
msgid "必须审查的合同"
msgstr "Contracts requiring review"

#: docs/delivery/security-review.md:0
msgid "地址保存位置"
msgstr "Address retention location"

#: docs/delivery/security-review.md:0
msgid "必要退出条件"
msgstr "Required exit conditions"

#: docs/delivery/security-review.md:0
msgid "F4 IRQ／callback 状态"
msgstr "F4 IRQ/callback state"

#: docs/delivery/security-review.md:0
msgid "正常 stop 解绑真实发布者；失败保留责任"
msgstr "Normal stop detaches actual publishers; failure retains responsibility"

#: docs/delivery/security-review.md:0
