msgid "作用不可逆，静态 owner 持续到复位"
msgstr "Irreversible effects; static owner remains until reset"

#: docs/delivery/security-review.md:17
msgid ""
"异步借用保存调用者地址是必要机制。诊断必须核对真实寿命，不能换成隐式 heap、删除 IRQ 表或屏障以绕过。失败的 Flash relock、DMA "
"drain 和硬件撤回必须保留隔离与恢复 责任，后到成功观察不自动清除锁存故障。模型验证软件合同，不能证明实际电气与复位。"
msgstr ""
"Asynchronous borrowing necessarily retains caller addresses. Review actual "
"lifetimes rather than introducing an implicit heap or deleting IRQ tables or "
"barriers to bypass diagnostics. Failed Flash relock, DMA drain and hardware "
"withdrawal retain quarantine and recovery duties; a later successful "
"observation does not automatically clear a latched fault. Models verify "
"software contracts, not actual electrical or reset behavior."

#: docs/delivery/security-review.md:21
msgid ""
"工具临时目录、进程组、路径身份与失败退出必须有真实回归。厂商导入保留原字节和许可； 未选 vendor 不建立生产支持。普通静态扫描不证明无漏洞，也不替代"
" IRQ、掉电、时序、 长期负载或产品安全资格。当前物理 HIL 为 `not_executed`；候选由同一源码的实际门禁建立。"
msgstr ""
"Tool temporary directories, process groups, path identity and failure exits "
"need real regressions. Vendor imports retain original bytes and licenses; "
"unselected vendors grant no production support. Ordinary static scanning "
"proves neither absence of vulnerabilities nor IRQ, power-loss, timing, "
"sustained-load or product safety qualification. Physical HIL is currently "
"`not_executed`; a candidate requires actual gates on the same source."
